# GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964 (msgpack Unpacker out-of-bounds read/crash)
# msgpack here is vendored inside pip itself (pip/_vendor/msgpack), pulled in
# by `pip install --upgrade pip` in the Dockerfile. It is not a project
# dependency - app/ never imports msgpack, and pip's vendored copy is only
# used internally by pip's own resolver/cache, not reachable at runtime.
# No requirements.txt/Dockerfile change can patch a version vendored inside
# pip's own release; revisit if a future pip release bundles a fixed copy.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964
